# OnRoad (vehicle sales & on-road quotes)

`project_tracker: github`

## What this is

Vietnam vehicle catalog and location-based on-road cost quotes. Split monorepo: Next.js UI in `apps/frontend`, Express API in `apps/backend`, shared types in `packages/shared`. Neon PostgreSQL is the database.

## Run

| Command | Effect |
|---|---|
| `npm run dev` (repo root) | Backend `:4000` + frontend `:3000` |
| `npm run dev:backend` | API only (`apps/backend`) |
| `npm run dev:frontend` | UI only (`apps/frontend`) |
| `npm run build` | Build both apps |
| `npm run test` | Run tests in both workspaces |

## Stack

- **Frontend:** Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4 (`apps/frontend/`)
- **Backend:** Express API, route handlers under `apps/backend/src/routes/handlers/`
- **Database:** Neon PostgreSQL via Drizzle (`apps/backend/src/server/db/`)

