## Auth & security notes

- HMAC bearer tokens: `admin` (catalog + quotes) or `sales` (quotes only)
- Login: `POST /api/auth/login`
- Do not commit `.env.local` or Neon passwords

## Environment

- Copy `.env.example` → `apps/backend/.env.local` and `apps/frontend/.env.local`
- Quote `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — unquoted `!` breaks bash `source`. Do not `source` `.env.local`
- Production: Vercel Root Directory = `apps/frontend` — UI + API on one deployment (`api/index.mjs`); Neon `DATABASE_URL` in Vercel env
